  "Every multiplier, histogram bucket, quantile bound and trend point in the advanced metrics is normalized against the {{interval}} interval of the selected mode, so they describe a polling rate this connection never ran at. The raw microsecond values and the counters remain valid. Move the keyboard to a port or hub that enumerates at {{required}}, then repeat the test before comparing modes.": "高级指标中的所有倍数、直方图分桶、分位边界和趋势点，都是按所选模式的 {{interval}} 间隔归一化的，因此它们描述的是本连接从未实际运行过的轮询速率。原始微秒数值和计数器仍然有效。请将键盘接到以 {{required}} 枚举的端口或集线器上，重新测试后再比较模式。",
