  "Maximum": "最大",
  "Delivery timing begins when firmware receives a keyboard report and ends on the keyboard USB IN completion, including queue wait. The minimum is this connection’s fixed offset between the firmware tick and the USB frame; it is re-drawn on every replug, so compare runs by Maximum minus Minimum rather than by the absolute values.": "传输时间从固件收到键盘报告开始，到键盘 USB IN 完成为止，包含队列等待。最小值是本连接中固件时钟节拍与 USB 帧之间的固定偏移，每次重新插拔都会重新确定，因此请用最大值减最小值来比较各次运行，而不要用绝对数值。",
