  "Complete tests are stored locally. Change polling mode manually, run another test, and return here to compare results.": "已完成的测试会保存在本地。请手动更改轮询模式，再运行一次测试，然后回到这里比较结果。",
  "Latest non-aborted result for each manually selected mode. Firmware and diagnostics protocol versions must match the current device.": "每个手动选择模式的最新未中断结果。固件与诊断协议版本必须与当前设备一致。",
  "Rows marked “speed mismatch” enumerated at a USB speed the selected mode cannot run at, so their normalized columns (p99 bound, > 2×) are not comparable with the other rows.": "标记为 “speed mismatch” 的行是以所选模式无法运行的 USB 速度枚举的，因此这些行的归一化列（p99 边界、> 2×）无法与其他行比较。",
  "Negotiated speed": "协商速度",
  "Date": "日期",
  "Duration": "时长",
  "Drops": "丢弃",
  "Queue": "队列",
  "Spread": "跨度",
  "Avg": "平均",
  "Max": "最大",
  "p99 bound": "p99 边界",
  "Loop max": "循环最大",
  "USB resets": "USB 复位",
  "speed mismatch": "速度不匹配",
  "Compare runs with <1>Spread</1>, Drops and Queue. Avg and Max each carry a constant offset that is fixed when the keyboard enumerates and is re-drawn on every replug, so the same firmware in the same mode can report very different microseconds between runs. Spread (Max minus Min, in polling intervals) removes that offset and shows how many extra intervals reports had to wait. The p99 and > 2× columns are measured against each mode’s own interval, so they answer “did this mode stay inside its own budget?” rather than which mode is faster.": "比较各次运行请使用 <1>跨度</1>、丢弃与队列。平均值和最大值都带有一个固定偏移，它在键盘枚举时确定、每次重新插拔都会重新抽取，因此同一固件、同一模式在不同运行之间的微秒数可能相差很大。跨度（最大 − 最小，以轮询间隔为单位）去掉了该偏移，显示报告多等待了几个间隔。p99 与 > 2× 两列是相对各模式自身的间隔测量的，因此它们回答的是“该模式是否守住了自己的预算”，而不是哪个模式更快。",
  "What this means": "查看说明",
  "Measurements": "测量值",
  "Timing": "时序",
  "Events": "事件",
  "Mode comparison": "模式对比",
  "Measures how the polling mode selected above actually behaves.": "测量上方所选轮询模式的实际表现。",
  "It answers one question: while the test ran, did the keyboard lose any key reports, pause, or lose its USB link? It only reads — it never changes the mode and never writes to the keyboard.": "它只回答一个问题：测试期间键盘是否丢失过按键报告、是否发生停顿、是否断开过 USB 连接。仅读取，不会更改模式，也不会写入键盘。",
  "No result has been captured for the current connection yet, so the last stored test is shown instead. Start a new test to measure the current connection.": "当前连接尚未采集到结果，因此改为显示上次保存的测试。若要测量当前连接，请开始新测试。",
  "Copy Diagnostic Report copies this same stored run.": "复制诊断报告复制的也是这次已保存的运行。",
  "Each line below covers only the category it names, over the window this test ran. Categories this test does not measure are not covered by it.": "下面每一行只涵盖其所指的类别，且仅限于本次测试运行的时间窗口。本次测试未测量的类别不在其中。",
  "Captured when this test ended, not a live reading.": "这是本次测试结束时捕获的数值，并非实时读数。",
  "These are the values captured at the end of this test, not a live reading — they only change when a test produces a new snapshot. Applying a polling mode restarts the keyboard, which zeroes them, so a test run right after a mode change always starts near zero. To check whether an unplug, suspend or speed change was counted, trigger it and then run another short test. RAM-only. They reset when the firmware restarts and are never written to EEPROM.": "这些是本次测试结束时捕获的数值，并非实时读数 — 只有当测试生成新快照时才会更新。应用轮询模式会重启键盘并将其清零，因此在更改模式后立即运行的测试总是从接近零开始。若要确认拔出、挂起或速度变化是否被计入，请先触发该操作，然后再运行一次短测试。仅存在于 RAM 中，固件重启时会重置，且永不写入 EEPROM。",
  "Compare runs with <1>Spread</1>, Drops and Queue — Avg and Max carry an offset that is re-drawn on every replug.": "比较各次运行请使用 <1>跨度</1>、丢弃与队列 — 平均值和最大值带有每次重新插拔都会重新抽取的偏移。"
}
